​1. Physical Driver Actuation (Lu-Bi Matrix)
​The physical interface between the validate_protocol.py core and the hardware is managed via the Predictive Physical Limiter.[1] The output signal from the Emergency Throttle is mapped directly to the voltage bias of the Lutetium-Bismuth (Lu-Bi) matrix.[1]
​1.1 Feedback Loop Design & Signal Flow
